Package: cinminai-applet
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Cin-MinAI <https://github.com/Brickmii/Cin-MinAI>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: cinnamon, python3, cinminai-sidebar (>= @RELEASE@)
Description: Cin-MinAI assistant: panel icon and Super+A
 The assistant's icon in the panel: it shows whether the assistant is ready,
 answering or resting, and a click opens it. At first login it is added to the
 panel and Super+A is set to open the assistant, once: if you remove the icon or
 change the key, it stays the way you left it.
